        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"6d70b59e-eaa3-4029-a227-18a21539f3a9\",\"review_text\":\"Best, most advanced music platform for sure, it's just the way to go and super pleasing to look at, use, works with everything, Spotify ftw\"},{\"review_id\":\"1b188bd5-8604-462f-b106-fedcd07651ad\",\"review_text\":\"we boycott this Sweden apps\"},{\"review_id\":\"9219813c-9fc7-4621-8240-0adc89e1d495\",\"review_text\":\"Best app for music 🎶 and music lovers\"},{\"review_id\":\"aab3ea05-6ed3-488f-9725-8346e529c0d1\",\"review_text\":\"This is realy good\"},{\"review_id\":\"274ab85b-f1b0-4f6a-8be9-50765985768b\",\"review_text\":\"Ive really liked spotify especially when they finally added tool songs. There my favorite band\"},{\"review_id\":\"5757e3ee-f609-4569-8de2-5627519dd905\",\"review_text\":\"Becoming worsee\"},{\"review_id\":\"f3150e22-30d0-454d-9fd9-644e39723168\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify has to be my best ever had music app😍. I love it here\"},{\"review_id\":\"038bbb90-b595-453b-818e-887f47a3465a\",\"review_text\":\"Love it!\"},{\"review_id\":\"4fa17991-f6dd-444c-9878-26055a48280e\",\"review_text\":\"Everytime my phone resets, Spotify ignores the SD card and my downloads disappear and I have to download everything again. It's very annoying.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c61549a8-0771-4532-9feb-50d106260519\",\"review_text\":\"Its feel like painkiller 🖤\"}]}"
